  "details": "The Android platform icon is so small on the new nameplates that at most distances I cannot make it out. From far away it looks like a small white dot, then closer a donut, then once you’re on top of the person you can maybe make out the android-shaped-hole in the donut. \n\nThis icon needs to be much larger, at least as large vertically as the text next to it, if not larger. And it should be green, like the android logo is everywhere else in the UI. A color would likely help being able to make it out from any distance. \n\nMy biggest complaint about the previous phone/tablet icon from earlier iterations was the minuscule size, and this new icon is no better.",
